[PrintTextModified Text:"乘上招待所【<ruby=\"UNDINE\">水精</ruby>之室】的<br>隐藏电梯——|#0105Adv04_Narrative001|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和可可来到了一个<br>秘密的地下设施。|#0105Adv04_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR10,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:这、这是什么鬼地方，冷死了……|#0105Adv04_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可，把门撑住吧。<br>……要是锁上了，我们就会被关在里面了。|#0105Adv04_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1,ArmR10,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:噫……！|#0105Adv04_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛也是昨晚才发现这里，<br>可可更是第一次来。|#0105Adv04_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可因为周围的寒气，加上一丝恐惧，<br>一边颤抖着，<br>一边好奇地环顾四周。|#0105Adv04_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR10,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:居然有这种地方……<br>所以你就是在这里操纵处刑台，<br>然后杀了亚里沙吗。|#0105Adv04_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……唔，我——|#0105Adv04_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛刚想反驳，却又立刻止住了自己。|#0105Adv04_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（现在就算我说亚里沙不是我杀的，<br>　也没有证据能让人信服……）|#0105Adv04_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（在剩下的时间里，必须找到有效的线索）|#0105Adv04_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

