; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『操作室』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:5-14
@UpdateWitchBook Id:5-14 Category:Clue Version:1
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:用手机拍摄了室内后，<br>艾玛长舒一口气。|#0105Adv04_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在艾玛身边无所事事的可可，<br>注意到自己手边有一个控制面板。|#0105Adv04_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:这是什么？|#0105Adv04_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:那就是典狱长说的【控制面板】。|#0105Adv04_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（昨天晚上没来得及仔细观察，<br>　原来就是用这个来切换处刑台的……）|#0105Adv04_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛再次仔细检查控制面板。|#0105Adv04_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（按典狱长的说法，<br>　昨晚是因为我操作了这个，所以处刑台才降下去了）|#0105Adv04_Ema007|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（看来不仅可以更换处刑台的装置，<br>　还能控制门开关……）|#0105Adv04_Ema008|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（再看一遍，还是不太明白具体怎么用……）|#0105Adv04_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:想到自己真的有可能<br>在无意间让亚里沙丧命，艾玛脸色发白。|#0105Adv04_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（现在不能想这个）|#0105Adv04_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:时间所剩无几。<br>艾玛迅速甩开这个念头，勉强保持冷静。|#0105Adv04_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……咦？<br>　不对，有点奇怪……）|#0105Adv04_Ema011|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛回想起<br>昨天来到这里的事。|#0105Adv04_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（那时候好像……<br>　把控制面板摔坏了）|#0105Adv04_Ema012|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（是有人来<br>　把控制面板换成新的了吗……？）|#0105Adv04_Ema013|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; ★証拠品：『操作盤』情報更新
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:5-17
@UpdateWitchBook Id:5-17 Category:Clue Version:2
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR10,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:喂，艾玛亲。好了没？<br>里面那扇门好像也锁着打不开……<br>再不出去我要被冻死了。|#0105Adv04_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……抱歉……！再等一下。|#0105Adv04_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1,ArmR10,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:真是的，难道你想把我<br>冻死在这里！？|#0105Adv04_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……再挣扎也没用了吧？|#0105Adv04_Coco007| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:可可嘴里念叨着抱怨的话，<br>但还是跟在艾玛身后。|#0105Adv04_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛焦急万分。<br>时限迫在眉睫，<br>却还没找到任何有用的线索。|#0105Adv04_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（怎么办，怎么办怎么办……！<br>　再这样下去我就要被处决了——！）|#0105Adv04_Ema015|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不能慌！<br>　要冷静、冷静地思考！）|#0105Adv04_Ema016|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:寒冷和焦急一样，剥夺着人的思考能力。<br>艾玛把手伸进口袋，摸到了钢笔。|#0105Adv04_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:神奇的是，<br>艾玛的身体顿时恢复了一点温暖。|#0105Adv04_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……|#0105Adv04_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛惊讶地拿出钢笔端详。|#0105Adv04_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（是钢笔在保护我吗……？）|#0105Adv04_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛闭上眼，调整呼吸，再睁开眼。|#0105Adv04_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时环顾操作室，<br>就注意到一处与昨晚不同的地方。|#0105Adv04_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:-6,3 Zoom:0.5 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
