@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:5-12
@UpdateWitchBook Id:5-12 Category:Clue Version:1
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:通风口的盖子被拆开，掉落在下方。|#0105Adv04_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:仔细一看，<br>盖子的固定装置被破坏了，<br>还留有被子弹破坏的痕迹。|#0105Adv04_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（子弹……！？难道是奈叶香……！？）|#0105Adv04_Ema020| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:往通风口里面看，宽度刚好能容一个人通过。|#0105Adv04_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:从这里应该能进去！|#0105Adv04_Ema021| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR10,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛亲，你该不会是想进去吧……？|#0105Adv04_Coco008| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:我们进去看看……！|#0105Adv04_Ema022| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive,ArmR10,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:真的假的啊。|#0105Adv04_Coco009| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛吞了吞口水，<br>爬着钻进了通风口。|#0105Adv04_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

