[PrintTextModified Text:——艾玛和可可到达的是一个<br>巨大的冷冻室。|#0105Adv04_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:变成魔女【残骸】的少女们，<br>被冰冻保存在这里。|#0105Adv04_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（和典狱长说的一样。<br>　这里是……）|#0105Adv04_Ema023|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（——魔女们长眠的地方）|#0105Adv04_Ema024| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1,ArmR10,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:好冷！冷死了！受不了啦！！|#0105Adv04_Coco010| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:冷冻室里实在太冷了，<br>要是站着不动就感觉马上要结冰了。|#0105Adv04_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和可可<br>决定分头在宽敞的室内进行搜查。|#0105Adv04_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR10,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:……总觉得这个房间，<br>我好像见过。|#0105Adv04_Coco011| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:正准备开始搜查时，<br>可可疑惑地喃喃自语道。|#0105Adv04_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1,ArmR10,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，对了！是在今天早上的梦里看到的！|#0105Adv04_Coco012| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:梦里……？<br>可可，这是什么意思……|#0105Adv04_Ema025| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛刚开口询问，<br>可可的身影已经被物体挡住，消失不见了。|#0105Adv04_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我也得赶紧调查才行）|#0105Adv04_Ema026| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛调整心态，<br>仔细观察起室内的情况。|#0105Adv04_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这是……！）|#0105Adv04_Ema027| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

