[PrintTextModified Text:迎接艾玛的是一扇巨大的门。|#0105Adv04_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive,ArmR7,ArmL6 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:好大啊……<br>该不会是给巨人用的吧。|#0105Adv04_Ema038| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:别、别说了……<br>怎么可能有那种怪物存在嘛……<br>|#0105Adv04_Coco019| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:可可靠近着眼前的巨门，<br>脸上掠过一丝恐惧。|#0105Adv04_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……啊，艾玛亲！<br>从这里能看到里面！|#0105Adv04_Coco020| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可在门下方发现了一个小窗，<br>立刻蹲下身兴奋地喊道。|#0105Adv04_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛也跑过来，凑近往里看，<br>只见里面是一个令人生畏的处刑台。|#0105Adv04_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR7,ArmL6 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:处刑台……<br>在上面被处刑的魔女，<br>是不是会被送到地下，然后要经过这里啊？|#0105Adv04_Ema039| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……到底是谁建造了<br>这么猎奇的设施啊。|#0105Adv04_Coco021| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……目睹之前的处刑，<br>真的觉得太过分了。|#0105Adv04_Ema040| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:这座大宅和这些装置，<br>就是为了将少女们的精神逼到极限<br>而建造的。|#0105Adv04_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛无法长时间直视那个处刑台，<br>很快就站了起来。|#0105Adv04_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR7,ArmL6 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:……唔，这个小洞看起来<br>怎么都进不了人的样子。|#0105Adv04_Coco022| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:可可试图将双臂伸进小窗，<br>但很快就放弃，站了起来。|#0105Adv04_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来这个大小<br>无论如何都不可能让人出入。|#0105Adv04_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR7,ArmL6 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:连小孩子都过不去啊～<br>……大概只有猫之类的小动物能钻过去吧？|#0105Adv04_Coco023| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（正如可可所说，<br>　这个小窗是难以供人通过的……）<br>|#0105Adv04_Ema041|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:话说回来，这扇门要怎么打开呢。|#0105Adv04_Ema042| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:没看到类似刚才那种控制面板，<br>应该不容易打开吧？|#0105Adv04_Coco024| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（带小窗的、打不开的巨门……吗）|#0105Adv04_Ema043| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

